      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: '

          NELL coughs, and pulls out her JOURNAL. The air hangs
          heavy with the scent of must and mildew. Space is empty, carrying with
          it only a sense of acrid loneliness.'
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
